  "usage_rules": [
    "These are blank master forms, not issued factory records. Do not mutate them into completed records.",
    "Create separately controlled actual records only after authorized work, approved numbering/access/retention rules and method acceptance.",
    "Every null actual value is unknown or absent, never zero or passed. Empty arrays contain no performed observations.",
    "Every unknown physical, rework, service, yield or cost limit blocks the affected operation or acceptance gate.",
    "Reference software, simulation, vendor source, independent review, physical tests and field tests remain distinct evidence classes.",
    "A physical result requires real specimen identity, authorized method, valid calibrated equipment, raw data, units, uncertainty and independent acceptance.",
    "Never store raw private keys, symmetric keys, passwords, join secrets, seeds, bootstrap tokens or recovery secrets. Use opaque key-management references or public certificate fingerprints.",
    "No price, quote, approved budget, supplier availability, signature, permission, physical proof or production yield is supplied.",
    "Keep failed and aborted attempts immutable. Retests and amendments link to the original rather than replace it.",
    "Pressure-test details and scientific endpoints belong to competent specialists. These forms contain no physical test setpoint or acoustic limit."
  ],
